# Saint Capybara anonymity: this file must never be committed with real
# content. It holds the creator's other names/handles/brands so
# tools/capy_check_brand.py can scan for accidental leakage without that
# list itself living in the (potentially public) repo. See
# docs/saint-capybara/brand.md "Operational anonymity checklist".
